  "note": "Whole (scenario, seed) units over jobs-v2. Every branch of a unit stays in that unit's split. Training feeds a fit, development feeds model selection, and calibration is read only after a backend is fixed. Training holds two job sizes at 15% and 35%, under an even split, and at 65% and 80%, over it. The final test holds four seen configurations on new seeds and the unseen 45% and 72% loads, one on each side of the even split. The out-of-distribution subset holds a 95% load and a 32 ms job size at 35% and 65%. Neither sealed split is run before a frozen candidate exists. The jobs-v1 pilot stays in splits-v1, and mixed-v1 stays in splits-v0."
